                      <td><strong>StaticCheck_codespell_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_link_validity_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_resource_existence_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_tag_closed_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_markdownlint</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_checkpr</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚠️ WARNING</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3dd7f759b16146a08dcb8b11e5426b56&pipelineRunId=9a4463970b614796971d163f4128175b&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/7540/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-25 16:43:04] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-25T16:42:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:43:04+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177139467,"discussion_id":"5889959299600c0bf8a71c3be97d8544415d87ed","body":"由于无法获取 git diff 且 PR 描述极为简要，以下基于 PR 标题、分支名和唯一变更文件的结构进行分析。\n\n#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 是针对 `GMMA8W4FakeQuantPreProcess` 内核的一次 bug 修复（分支名关联 SF-910），涉及 A8W4（激活 8 位、权重 4 位）反量化预处理流程。变更仅影响文件 `grouped_matmul_antiquant_a8w4_pre.h`，修改规模为 +5/-5 行，属于小范围精准修复。该内核负责 Grouped MatMul 场景下 int4 权重数据的格式转换（ND/NZ）以及 per-channel 的 scale 预处理。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **A8W4 反量化预处理逻辑修正**：在 `GMMA8W4FakeQuantPreProcess` 模板类的 `Process()` 或 `ScaleProcess()` 方法中，针对 A8W4 数据流进行了小范围逻辑修正（±5 行），修复了与数据拷贝、偏移计算或对齐相关的 bug\n- **ND/NZ 格式处理路径调整**：修改可能涉及 `Process()` 中 NZ 格式的数据重排（`DataCopy` 到 `ALocalI8NZ` / `BLocalI8NZ`）或 ND 格式的直通路径，以及与之关联的 `SetFlag`/`WaitFlag` 同步原语\n- **Scale 处理的数据写回修正**：修改可能涉及 `ScaleProcess()` 中 `isSingleTensor` 两条分支下的 `DataCopy`/`DataCopyPad` 调用（第 258/260/301/303 行附近），修正 scale 结果写回 `scaleOutGm` 时的数据长度或对齐参数\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-25T17:31:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T17:31:37+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177139943,"discussion_id":"b69dbe9ab7add9b19330daea09ae1a19b378eaa7","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n对文件 `gmm/grouped_matmul/op_kernel/grouped_matmul_antiquant_a8w4_pre.h` 的变更进行了审查。\n\n### 发现的问题\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0 | 0 |\n| P1 | 1 |\n| P2 | 0 |\n| P3 | 0 |\n\n### 整体风险评估\n\n本次变更是一个 bug 修复，将 `DataCopy` 替换为 `DataCopyPad` 并纠正了事件同步方向（`MTE2_MTE3` → `MTE3_MTE2`）。但修复仅应用到了 `isSingleTensor == 0`（多 tensor）分支，**遗漏了 `else`（单 tensor）分支中对应的 `DataCopy` → `DataCopyPad` 更新**（line 303）。这导致单 tensor 路径仍然使用旧的有问题的代码，行为与多 tensor 路径不一致，属于中等风险的遗漏。\n\n### 已审查的文件\n\n- `gmm/grouped_matmul/op_kernel/grouped_matmul_antiquant_a8w4_pre.h`：发现 1 个 P1 问题（单 tensor 分支未同步更新 DataCopy → DataCopyPad）。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 1 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 0 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-25T17:32:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T17:32:56+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177139956,"discussion_id":"76a7d6b68ca957df4dbffe8dd5d640ef01138dbb","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n在 `isSingleTensor == 0` 分支（多 tensor 路径，line 260）中，`DataCopy` 已被替换为 `DataCopyPad`，并使用了新的 size 计算方式 `{1, uint16_t(loop_size_u64 * sizeof(bfloat16_t)), 0, 0}`。但在 `else` 分支（单 tensor 路径，line 303）中，仍然保留旧的 `DataCopy(scaleOutGm[...], scaleBF16, (loop_size_u64 + 16 - 1) / 16 * 16)` 调用，未做相同更新。\n\n两个分支在旧代码中的 `DataCopy` 参数完全一致（仅 GM 目标地址不同），说明它们应该做相同的修复。此遗漏导致单 tensor 路径仍然使用可能有问题的旧 size 计算方式（`(loop_size_u64 + 16 - 1) / 16 * 16` 按 u64 对齐，而非按 bf16 字节数计算），与多 tensor 路径行为不一致。\n\n**建议**：将 line 303 的 `DataCopy` 调用同样替换为 `DataCopyPad`，与 line 260 的多 tensor 分支保持一致：`DataCopyPad(scaleOutGm[start_element_u64 + start_loc], scaleBF16, {1, uint16_t(loop_size_u64 * sizeof(bfloat16_t)), 0, 0});`\n\n```suggestion\n    DataCopyPad(scaleOutGm[start_element_u64 + start_loc], scaleBF16, {1, uint16_t(loop_size_u64 * sizeof(bfloat16_t)), 0, 0});\n```\n","created_at":"2026-06-25T17:32:57+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T19:51:19+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6822c6282f11da2d75c956d6","login":"huang-jz","object_id":"6822c6282f11da2d75c956d6","name":"huang-jz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/huang-jz"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":303,"end_new_line":303,"start_old_line":303,"end_old_line":303,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":177168742,"discussion_id":"a967297b8e23c6c76916413140cbaadce2fbe96e","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-25T19:51:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T19:51:37+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c6282f11da2d75c956d6","login":"huang-jz","object_id":"6822c6282f11da2d75c956d6","name":"huang-jz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/huang-jz"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177169277,"discussion_id":"690738a71c77cf9efdc84a2a87b24988a30b5621","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=fbb41a735a5f401cb43e00580178e829&projectName=CANN'>fbb41a735a5f401cb43e00580178e829</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=fbb41a735a5f401cb43e00580178e829&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n             